WEBVTT

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.930
The cultural festival will have
a cross-dressing competition.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.100
We'll determine our class
representative with a vote.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.180
I've seen this as a plot in BL!

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.070
Hirano-senpai, it's terrible!

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:32.690
Oh, great...

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.550
"Sasaki and Miyano"

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.120
"I Don't Want to Pressure Him"

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:08.580
"I Don't Want to Pressure Him"

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:08.580
Hey, everyone.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.040
What's goin' on?

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.090
Oh, Chairman.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:16.840
Miyano agreed to rep his class
in the cross-dressing competition.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.760
If you truly don't wanna do it,

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:22.720
refuse with the same persistence
you show in asking about my dorm life.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:25.770
That's sort of a separate issue...

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:27.980
Yeah? How, exactly?

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.480
Ah, yes...

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:31.020
The Miss...

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.610
The Miss (TBD) Competition.

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.230
Are you okay?

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:38.450
The Cultural Festival Committee
revealed their tastes

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:42.530
when they wrested permission
to hold it from the Student Council.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:50.080
Remembering the look on the Student
Council President's face makes me laugh.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:52.540
Chairman, you're easily amused, huh?

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:56.340
"That was a sadistic face"

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:56.340
Easily amused how, exactly?

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:59.670
Miyano, don't you have a thing
about looking like a girl?

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:04.260
My classmates said they'd help me,
so if it's just this once...

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:07.220
Oh? That's a change in attitude.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.980
Find your fish in the sea?

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:10.480
My fi-- Th-Th-Th--

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.480
That's not it at all!

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.980
Oh, I see.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:19.940
Why would a boys' school do something
as BL-ish as a cross-dressing competition?

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:21.650
--The votes are tallied.
--This is the one time
I can be glad I'm a <i>fudansh</i>--

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.410
--The class representative is...
--This is the one time
I can be glad I'm a <i>fudansh</i>--

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.280
--...Miyano.
--This is the one time
I can be glad I'm a <i>fudansh</i>--

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.370
Huh?

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:26.740
Absolutely not!

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:29.500
I want a tall buff guy to do it!

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.250
Miyano, you're our best shot at winning.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.710
Listen,

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:39.510
the class A guys are saying "class B
is full of butterfaces. They're screwed!"

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.840
They're <i>mocking </i>us!

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.220
It's personal...

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.930
You can have Kuresawa
crossdress as a substitute.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.770
Sure. I'm fine either way.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.020
How do <i>you </i>feel?

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:55.110
Please! You can wear
a not super girly outfit!

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.650
He's desparate...

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.860
Well, if it's not just me...

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:02.110
I'm down. I bet my
girlfriend would love it.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:05.740
Hell yeah! Now we're certain to win!

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:08.490
You can back out any time.
I'll take your place.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.120
Same goes for me!

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.370
Oh, okay. Thanks.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.130
The cross-dressing and my face...

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:19.710
Does it just not bother me as much now?

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:24.880
Kuresawa and Tashiro supporting me
might be a big part of it, but...

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:31.180
You might grow taller than me one day,
and your face might change completely.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.890
But I think--

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:37.310
Why did I just think of Sasaki?!

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.570
What's so funny?

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.980
His hair is wild.

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:45.360
You don't seem to be to upset about it.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:49.620
Just standing there is...
I think I could do it...

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.490
No, I <i>can </i>do it, but...

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.620
That's a lot of faltering.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:58.000
They said my outfit wouldn't
be super girly, but then everyone...

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.750
Well, if we're doing this,
let's do a sailor uniform!

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.130
It should be a blazer.

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:03.800
--A priestess outfit.
--Lady teacher.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.890
Absolutely not. Did you
forget about my condition?

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:13.890
Sounds like the uniforms
you'd see on a DVD or something.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.980
Oh, <i>that's </i>where it came from.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.230
Want me to bring you some outfits?

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:22.820
Huh? Chairman, you have some?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:28.200
--Is that his thing?
--Come on now. What are you thinking?

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.660
They're not mine.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:36.500
My older sister's an <i>otaku</i>,
and she has all sorts of outfits.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.000
An <i>otaku</i>... Speciall outfits...

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.790
Cosplay!

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.420
Cards...

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.090
Nobody claimed them?

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.800
I guess not.

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.470
All right.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.640
Let's have a little contest.
Loser has to lock up.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:51.890
Excuse me?

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.770
Just go with it. Shall we play Old Maid?

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:56.480
He just wants to goof off.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.440
It's pretty late.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:03.650
The Discipline Committee is still here?

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.320
Wonder if Mya-chan's here.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:10.320
Oh, Sasaki. Good timing!

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:11.700
It is?

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.330
Take these.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.330
Old Maid. Take over for me.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.330
Huh?

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.710
I forgot about a ping-pong club meeting.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.710
I'll pay you back later. Promise.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:21.710
Okay...

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.130
Have fun!

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.880
Sorry. Gotta run.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.510
Are you kidding me?

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:31.510
Why are your hands so big?

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.890
The Chairman made pairs every time!

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:36.930
Am I just bad at Old Maid?

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:42.400
I heard that the first person to have
the joker is the most likely to lose.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.230
What?!

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:46.280
So Mya-chan had it first.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.610
I lost!

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:52.320
I told you that was the joker.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:56.370
I thought you were bluffing!
The game is psychological!

00:06:56.370 --> 00:07:00.210
Okay, Miyano. Don't forget
to lock up. I'm leaving.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:02.500
Okay.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:06.380
Oh, Sasaki-senpai, you don't have to stay.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.210
Sorry for dragging you into my job.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:09.470
It's fine.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:13.680
Are you taking the key to the staff room?

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.510
Yes.

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:15.720
I'll come with you.

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:17.430
Do you need to see a teacher?

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:20.060
No. The one I need to see is...

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.650
I wanna see the person I like.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:29.780
E... Erm...

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:37.370
Excuse me! I brought back
the Discipline Committee's key!

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:44.540
I told him I would thiink about it, but...

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:48.710
"You don't know if you like me?"
"Then"

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:48.710
"You don't know if you like me?

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:49.960
"Then"

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:49.960
Then...

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.630
"Then"

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.630
Did you hate that?"

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.810
B--

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:03.350
Sigh. Senpai and I...

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:06.360
Is it... BL?

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:07.820
Should I--

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:09.650
No.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.150
No, no, no, no!

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:14.030
"Tell Me With Your Eyes"

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:14.030
N-Not like that!

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:15.780
"Tell Me With Your Eyes"

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:15.780
Think of another way!

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:19.040
"Tell Me With Your Eyes"

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:19.040
Don't turn things into BL!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.540
Sasaki-senpai.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.420
Mya-chan.

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:27.840
Are you going home?

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.590
Yup. Let's walk together.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.260
Okay.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:34.090
Oh, right. Here. I finished reading it.

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:36.390
I like this author's work.

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:37.390
Huh?

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:40.720
The very first manga you lent me
was by this author, right?

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.180
Y-Yes!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:45.600
I'm glad. I like this author, too.

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:51.780
You know, since it was so good,
I tried to have my sister read it.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:52.900
What?

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.240
But she was too busy with
a report or something for college.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.490
Oh, I see.

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:00.330
Was that bad?

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.370
No, it's just...

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:06.750
Everyone has their own preferences,
so the people who hate it hate it...

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:11.000
If you aren't careful, you'll give
someone an unexpected shock.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.550
Oh.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:14.840
Yeah, I was pretty surprised at first.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.260
I'm sorry!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:21.010
But thanks to that, I found some good
manga, and now I also get to talk to you.

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:22.180
So I'm glad.

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:27.310
Why is Senpai so...

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:35.610
I'm also happy I get to have
these conversations. Thank you.

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:37.660
Sure. And thanks to you, too.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:40.080
Oh? Why?

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.870
I just feel like it.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:46.460
I'm gonna go buy a drink. Wait here a sec.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.580
Okay.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:51.960
Miyano?

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:55.380
It <i>is </i>you. It's been a while.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.380
Makimura?

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.390
You forgot your middle school classma--

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:00.890
Your stuff is falling.

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:03.520
Paints?

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.020
Yep. Thanks.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.310
So you're still painting.

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:12.320
Sure am. I was just getting
supplies for the art club.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:16.610
Come to think of it, she walked
around with a big canvas then, too.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:18.150
Hey, while I've got you,

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:20.570
Miyano, will you model for me?

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.240
That was sudden.

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:23.990
Makimura, who's that?

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.290
Your boyfriend?

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:28.920
No. He's a classmate from middle school.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:31.790
Go to the teacher's car.
I'll be there soon.

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:32.840
Gotcha.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.300
--C'mon. Let's go.
--Are you sure?

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.340
Yeah.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:38.760
Right now I have a mission..
To recruit you as my model!

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:40.340
I decline.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:43.260
What? That's a shame. Twice in a row.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:44.350
Twice in a row?

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:45.520
Yeah.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:47.180
Remember in middle school?

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:51.980
I wanted you to model in
girls' clothes. But you declined.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.520
Wear girls' clothes for a bit.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.230
I don't want to.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:58.360
Wait, <i>that's </i>what you meant?

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:01.990
What's what I meant?

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:07.450
I thought for sure she wanted
to tease me by taking pictures of it.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.370
Miyano, you see...

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:14.130
In middle school, your features were
so young and... androgynous, is it?

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:17.210
It was a form I couldn't
help but want to paint!

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:20.220
It was a serious request...

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.380
What is it?

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:25.680
Your frame is more masculine now, so
I was considering girl clothing options.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:28.980
And whether to hide the masculine
parts like your jaw and arms.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.940
I'm not doing it.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:32.980
You're taller now, too.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:35.860
In middle school,
wasn't I taller than you?

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:39.280
No, I was taller. I'm certain.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.530
I won by this much.

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:42.070
--It's like comparing the heights
of acorns at that point.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:43.990
--I wonder why.
--It's like comparing the heights
of acorns at that point.

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:44.870
--I wonder why.
--You don't think that
sounds hollow right now?

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:47.120
--I don't feel awkward.
--You don't think that
sounds hollow right now?

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.040
--I don't feel awkward.
--Motoyama had everyone's
heights memorized back then.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:51.410
--After it bothered me so much.
--Motoyama had everyone's
heights memorized back then.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:53.170
Because he...

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:55.250
I'll still like you.

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.840
Is it because he said that to me?

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.260
You're hands, too. Look!

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.180
Put out your left hand.

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.800
Okay, sure.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.980
The skeletal structure
is totally masculine...

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:18.110
Don't.

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:24.410
Sorry, Makimura. See ya around.

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:27.990
I...

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:31.040
I need to paint him!
What was that expression?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.250
Uh...

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:36.540
Um...

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:43.430
I'm sorry. I got in the way.

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:48.850
You... weren't in the way.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:52.180
Our conversation was basically over...

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:53.730
Oh.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:58.610
Hey, Mya-chan...

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:03.320
The girl you mentioned you
liked before... that was her, right?

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:16.370
The girl I <i>used to </i>like.

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:22.130
I realized I don't anymore.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:27.800
Oh...

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:35.600
I'm sorry.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:38.860
I didn't hurt you when I pulled you away?

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:41.480
No. I'm fine.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:45.700
I'm a guy, too. That little won't hurt me.

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:48.700
It's not about gender.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:52.950
I don't want to be rough
with someone I like.

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:10.680
Um... If you suddenly
say stuff like that...

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.350
You'll make me blush.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.350
Miya--

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:17.640
Ah! We missed the train!

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:20.270
It's hard to run up steps!

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.730
Reedy to go?

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:24.980
Yes.

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.580
Mya-chan.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:39.000
I want you to know I wasn't
trying to rush you just now.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:41.920
I know.

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:56.730
The skeletal structure
is totally masculine...

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:59.690
My hands are masculine...

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.360
Senpai's hands are huge!

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:07.490
Is something wrong?

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.860
N-No, it's nothing.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:17.160
Once you take that out you can go home.
Take some bread with you.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.160
Mya-chan...

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:21.920
...used to like that girl.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.920
I don't remember her face.

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.590
Good morning.

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:30.590
G-Good morning.

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:35.390
But she was smaller than him.

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:38.850
Of course. Miyano's a guy.

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:44.440
We sat next to each other and
were usually in the same group.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:46.650
She was easy to talk to.

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:51.450
In middle school, girls in particular
would tell me my face was feminine...

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:54.240
I don't think they meant
anything by it, but...

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:58.120
...at one point, I got
extra sick of hearing it.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:01.250
She happened to say it to me then, too...

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.960
It was actually a misunderstanding.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:08.210
But I started talking
to her less and less.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:09.760
That's all of it.

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.300
I see.

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:16.350
The fact that he told me about it

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:20.430
means Mya-chan has
processed it all now, right?

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:23.520
But, even if Mya-chan doesn't like her,

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:26.110
if <i>she </i>likes <i>him</i>, then...

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:30.650
I frickin' hate this.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:31.530
Dammit.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:34.740
I mean, we're already
in a new school term.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.080
Good morning, Sasaki-senpai.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.540
Morning, Kuresawa-kun.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:44.370
You're out early.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:46.790
Do you live near here?

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:48.800
Yeah, no.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:52.800
The hospital my girlfriend
is staying in is near here.

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:58.720
We studied together there yesterday,
but she said I left my notebook.

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:00.720
I'm just going to grab it before school.

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:02.390
Oh.

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:05.480
His girlfriend is in the hospital...

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.560
Are you working an early shift?

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:08.650
Shift?

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:14.490
Oh, sorry. I saw you working
at a bakery near here a while back.

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:15.200
Oh.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:15.950
"Sasaki Bakery"

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:15.950
Oh.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.530
"Sasaki Bakery"

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.530
It's my family's bakery.

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:20.080
I only help when I manage to get up early.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.120
Oh, I see.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.120
I wonder if Miyano has this intel.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.210
Do you visit your girlfriend often?

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.380
When I don't have
club activities or anything.

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:33.510
But I didn't after I got into that fight.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.010
Right.

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:38.970
Thank you very much
for interceding in that fight.

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:43.480
No big deal. Don't worry about it.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:47.100
It wasn't much of an intercession.
I lost, after all.

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:49.190
Thanks.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:50.770
Mind if I buy a drink?

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.360
Go ahead.

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:56.320
Come to think of it,
what was that fight about?

00:17:56.320 --> 00:18:00.200
Well, it was because
I didn't mind my business.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:03.700
O--wait, <i>you </i>picked the fight?

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:07.370
They were badmouthing
each other's girlfriends,

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:10.250
and I had just fought with mine.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:15.920
I felt guilty and took my frustration out
by saying something I shouldn't have.

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:19.840
It was thoughtless of me. My apologies.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:22.970
I won't get in a fight again.
It made my girlfriend mad.

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.020
Yeah, fights are dangerous.

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:28.520
His main reason
seems to be his girlfriend...

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:32.860
Oh. Senpai, if you have time,
would you like to meet her?

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:38.280
No, no. I'm sure I'd just be intruding.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:41.700
It would be fine, but okay.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:43.910
Then maybe after she gets released.

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:46.120
Yeah.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.460
She said she wanted to see the real thing.

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:56.210
Man, that surprised me.

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:59.090
I got so awake, I didn't go back to sleep.

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:01.470
Sasaki-senpai.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.640
Good morning.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:06.520
Oh, right. I'm early today.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.640
Morning, Mya-chan.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.900
Thanks, Kuresawa-kun.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:14.940
You listen to music
pretty often, don't you?

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.940
Yeah. Wanna listen?

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:21.240
I added some CDs yesterday,
so there's new stuff, too.

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:22.570
Let's do an intro quiz.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:26.490
Um, I don't know
if I know any of the songs.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.500
I don't think we listen to the same stuff.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.870
True.

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:34.630
Then let's find songs you know instead.

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:36.960
Oh, I know this one.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:40.630
It's a theme song from a drama
that aired recently. A romance.

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:45.430
Oh, right. I wasn't sure
whether to buy it.

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:48.350
I got excited turning things into BL...

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.940
If you like the song,
I could lend you the CD.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:52.270
Huh?

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:57.190
From the second track on,
the mood changes. It's good.

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:59.400
Then may I borrow it?

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:02.030
Yeah. I'll bring it tomorrow.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:04.910
People borrow and lend CDs, too, huh?

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.160
I never really did that before.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.660
I've done it a lot.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:12.500
Ogasawara likes similar bands to me.

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.170
Oh, here are the lyrics.

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:17.880
I've done it whenever I wanted
to see the cover or the lyrics.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:22.050
Me, too! I like borrowing
and lending manga with people,

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:25.550
and I like the covers
and I like the feel of them.

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:26.470
I like him...

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:29.020
Wait, I'm off topic, huh?

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:32.270
Maybe I do, too. Like lining them up...

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:34.100
Or organizing them by creator.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:36.020
I do that!

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:39.650
Huh. So I like the feel of CDs.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:45.820
Oh, Senpai, new volumes
came out over summer break.

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:48.740
How do you want to handle it?

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:51.330
Oh, right. Exactly.

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:54.000
I wanted to talk to you about it.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.960
That manga you lent me before the break.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:00.590
I saw the next volume, so I bought it.

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:04.340
--What?
--It ended at a crazy good part again.

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:05.470
What?!

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:09.010
Mya-chan?

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:13.730
Y-You bought it?

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:18.570
And it's... in your room?

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:20.530
Yeah.

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:25.160
Senpai, do you happen to actually
have tons of manga at home?

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:27.280
Not really.

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:31.200
So, um, you bought the next volume.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:35.250
Yeah, I wanted to kno--

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:41.250
Thank you!

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:50.060
Oh, I have to be in the classroom
early today. See you later.

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:51.390
Right.

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:56.940
Let me know what you thought about it!

00:21:56.940 --> 00:21:58.190
Will do.

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:02.320
Morning, Sasaki.

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:03.650
Guess what. Today--

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:05.530
Tell me later.

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:08.910
--Oh, come on.
--I don't want to pressure him...

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:13.240
I almost hugged him!

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:47.380
"Episode 8: 'I Realized.'"
